    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>One of Ravisin's awakened beasts, named Karra (Awakened White Moose) after someone the druid once knew. Intelligent, vindictive, and absolutely loyal to Ravisin. Uses the magic mirror in the elven tomb to scry on loggers and hunters. Speaks Druidic and Common.</p><p><strong>Charge:</strong> 20ft+ toward target then antlers hit \u2014 extra 2d8+6 bludgeoning, DC 16 STR save or prone.</p>"
      },
